=== Subaccounts for WooCommerce ===
Contributors: mediaticus
Tags: sub account, company accounts, multi user, user switching, woocommerce b2b
Tested up to: 6.7
Requires PHP: 5.7
Stable tag: 1.6.5
License: GPLv2 or later
